* JUSTIFICATION: revised ITER scaling (IPDG89)

i_density_limit = 7
* DESCRIPTION:   Switch for density limit to enforce (icc=5);
* JUSTIFICATION: Use Greenwald density limit

i_beta_fast_alpha = 1
