* JUSTIFICATION: 

dx_tf_turn_insulation = 2.0d-3
* DESCRIPTION:   Conduit insulation thickness (m)
* JUSTIFICATION: 

dx_tf_wp_insulation   = 0.008
* DESCRIPTION:   Ground insulation thickness surrounding winding pack (m)
* JUSTIFICATION: 

